 Firestore security rules.\n   - `teacher.html`:\n     - Cleaned up: removed \"Open Student Quiz\" button, removed \"Load Default C Quiz\" button, removed Firebase branding paragraph.\n     - Side icon button (`.edge-tab-btn`) with gear SVG opens an edge slide-over panel (`.edge-panel`) with backdrop.\n     - Renamed \"Save to Firebase\" to \"Save to Quiz\"; status updated to \"Saving...\" and \"Saved Successfully to Student Quiz File! Quiz is live.\"\n     - Replaced \"Download Quiz JSON\" with \"Download QUIZ Json\" which downloads `index.html`.\n     - Note: `teacher.html` still contains `defaultQuiz` embedded locally at line 141 and used in `loadTeacherQuiz()`.\n   - `HISTORY.md`:\n     - Tracks Patches 1.0.0 through 1.0.9 detailing all changes and rationales.\n   - `vercel.json`:\n     - Static deployment config with `cleanUrls: true`.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - **Firestore Security Rules**: User deployed custom rules:\n     - `/quizzes/{quizId}`: `allow read: if true; allow write: if false;` -> Blocks browser client writes (`403 PERMISSION_DENIED`).\n     - `/quizzes/{quizId}/submissions/{subId}`: `allow create: if request.resource.data.keys().hasOnly(['n','s','raw','sw','pen','sc','tot','ts','t','code','submittedAt']) && request.resource.data.n is string && request.resource.data.n.size() < 100 && request.resource.data.s is string && request.resource.data.s.size() < 100;`.\n   - **Dual-Mode Compatibility**: Browser ES modules (`<script type=\"module\">` importing relative `./firebase-config.js`) trigger CORS origin `'null'` blocking on `file:///`. Using Google's compat scripts via `https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.14.0/firebase-*-compat.js` works seamlessly under both `file:///` and HTTP/Vercel.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - *CORS block on `file:///`*: Relative imports in `<script type=\"module\">` failed with `ERR_FAILED` from origin `null`. Fixed by inlining config and using Firebase compat scripts.\n   - *AI Answer Key Leak*: Gemini extracted all 20